{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2022-01-27 10:00:00', 'title': "DUPONT EARNS PERFECT SCORE ON HUMAN RIGHTS CAMPAIGN FOUNDATION'S 2022 CORPORATE EQUALITY INDEX", 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL., JAN. 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE:DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED A 2022 "BEST PLACE TO WORK" FOR LGBTQ+ EQUALITY BY THE HUMAN RIGHTS CAMPAIGN (HRC) FOUNDATION AND RECEIVED A SCORE OF 100% ON THE HRC\'S CORPORATE EQUALITY INDEX (CEI), THE NATION\'S FOREMOST BENCHMARKING SURVEY AND REPORT MEASURING CORPORATE POLICIES AND PRACTICES RELATED TO LGBTQ+ WORKPLACE EQUALITY.'}